# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# BDM P1+P2 — Environment Variables (template)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored), then fill in the API keys.
# Most defaults are fine for local development.
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#     # ... edit NEWS_API_KEY and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY ...
#     docker compose up -d
#
# ─── MinIO Object Store (Landing Zone) ───────────────────────────────────────
# `localhost:9000` works when running scripts on the host;
# inside the Docker network the address is `minio:9000` (Airflow/Streamlit
# get this baked into their environment via docker-compose.yml).
MINIO_ENDPOINT=localhost:9000
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=admin
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=password
MINIO_BUCKET=landing-zone

# ─── Milvus (Exploitation Zone — vector store) ───────────────────────────────
# `localhost` from the host; `milvus` inside the Docker network.
MILVUS_HOST=localhost
MILVUS_PORT=19530

# ─── Kafka (Streaming hot path) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# `localhost:9092` from host; `kafka:29092` inside the Docker network.
KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS=localhost:9092

# ─── External API Keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GNews — daily news headlines. Free tier (100 req/day) is enough for daily
# snapshots. Get one at https://gnews.io/
NEWS_API_KEY=

# Anthropic — powers the conversational podcast (Reasoner + Voice + Interviewer
# agents). Without it the agents still run, but they produce only the grounded
# prompt with no in-character answer. Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ─── LLM Tuning (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Defaults are fine; override only if you want a different Claude model or
# longer/shorter answers.
LLM_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
LLM_MAX_TOKENS=1024

# ─── Hacker News & other public APIs ────────────────────────────────────────
# Philosophers API, Gutendex, Wikipedia, Wikiquote, Stack Exchange and the
# HN Algolia index are all public and require NO authentication.
